12. GET entities?limit=0 (without count) - 400 error
====================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 150

{
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData",
  "title": "Invalid request",
  "detail": "limit=0 is only valid when count=true"
}



13. GET entities?offset=10 - empty array
========================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: </ngsi-ld/v1/entities?type=T&limit=20&offset=0>; rel="prev"; type="application/json"
Content-Length: 3

[]



